{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a clean and modern Contact Us section split into two parts (left and right).
    
    Left Side:
    
    Add a heading text setting (e.g., “Write to us”).
    
    Add a subheading text setting (for a short description paragraph).
    
    Below that, include a contact form with four input fields:
    
    Name (required)
    
    Mobile (required)
    
    Email (required)
    
    Message / Query (textarea, required)
    
    Add a submit button with editable text (default: “Submit Details”).
    
    The form should submit using Shopify’s default form system (form 'contact'), and display success/error messages on submission.
    
    Right Side:
    
    Add a background image picker for the right-side background.
    
    On top of this image, place a content card with:
    
    A small heading (e.g., “Get in Touch”)
    
    A short paragraph for intro text
    
    Three info blocks:
    
    Phone number (editable text, with a phone icon)
    
    Email ID (editable text, with a mail icon)
    
    Office address (editable text, with an optional link setting labeled “View on Google Map”)
    
    Each info block should include an icon (SVG or emoji), a label, and the actual value text below it.
    
    Layout:
    
    Use a two-column layout, left for the form and right for contact info.
    
    Keep spacing balanced and maintain rounded corners and soft shadows like a card layout.
    
    The right side’s content should appear over a background image with a semi-transparent gradient overlay for readability.
    
    Make sure the section is responsive, stacking vertically on smaller screens.
    
    Section name: “Contact Us Split Section”
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

